{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding on multiprofile data with avgpool aggregation, compared to the singleprofile baseline (config_001). Validation accuracy of 0.590664 and F1 of 0.572658 suggest multiprofile data improves performance. Uncertainty remains about the optimal aggregation methods and the potential benefits of multimodal components, as this experiment only isolates profile setting and uses a single aggregation approach."
}

